n't see the option. Apparently we can \"Past as Unique\" only if we copied from the dropdown menu then past from the dropdown menu too. I might open an issue on this.\r\n\r\nHow did you copy the resource? The Copy/Paste options from the dropdown use a different system than other places in the editor (it doesn't rely on the OS clipboard either).\r\n\r\nChanging this behavior is arguably proposal territory, as people may not expect the different copy/paste systems to work with each other (e.g. if you copy a resource file in the FileSystem dock, should it affect the dropdown?).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308132260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3311186709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103980#issuecomment-3311186709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103980","id":3311186709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FXLMV","user":{"login":"BrokAnkle","id":94972613,"node_id":"U_kgDOBakqxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94972613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle","html_url":"https://github.com/BrokAnkle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gith